      en: ["Oldest sugar factory in Sudan", "Founded in the 1960s", "Center in Gezira", "Important industrial heritage", "Guneid was the first modern sugar factory in Sudan and processes sugarcane from the Gezira region.", "Located in the Northeast African state of Sudan.", "The region is shaped by the Nile and the Nubian Desert.", "Climate is mostly hot and dry, with desert and Sahel zones."]
